OL,3,GNEWSATeen blinded by firework wants ban
OL,4,Aon public sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager blinded by a firework on
OL,7,FBonfire Night has called for a ban on
OL,8,Fthem being sold to the public.
OL,10,FTom Parnaby was 18 when he and a friend
OL,11,Fwere badly injured in the accident on 5
OL,12,FNovember 2025.
OL,14,FHe is now campaigning for more
OL,15,Fcontrolled firework displays and
OL,16,Ftighter regulations on sales.
OL,18,FTom, who has since become a father for
OL,19,Fthe first time, said despite what
OL,20,Fhappened to him he does not hate
OL,21,Ffireworks, but thinks the "public sale
OL,22,Fof them is crazy".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
